WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:06.812
Hi everyone, I'm Liam,
and I'm glad to be your host today.

2
00:00:06.989 --> 00:00:08.439
Students have their AI.

3
00:00:08.935 --> 00:00:10.235
Teachers have theirs.

4
00:00:10.620 --> 00:00:12.110
And the two never meet.

5
00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:14.772
So let us introduce you to Bluestift:

6
00:00:15.032 --> 00:00:17.091
the platform where they finally do.

7
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.600
Bluestift is a collaborative platform,
built around Raya,

8
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.482
the AI we designed for learning.

9
00:00:23.651 --> 00:00:25.351
Students learn, fail,

10
00:00:25.351 --> 00:00:28.645
challenge themselves,
and find out exactly where they're stuck.

11
00:00:28.645 --> 00:00:32.228
And not just on their own:
their school gets the whole picture too.

12
00:00:32.228 --> 00:00:34.295
So they don't just learn more easily.

13
00:00:34.295 --> 00:00:35.495
They learn better.

14
00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.504
Here's a quick look at Raya, which is more
than an AI: it's a platform of its own.

15
00:00:42.017 --> 00:00:44.297
Ask Raya anything from your dashboard.

16
00:00:44.742 --> 00:00:46.942
Instead of handing you the answer,

17
00:00:46.942 --> 00:00:48.295
Raya helps you find it.

18
00:00:48.473 --> 00:00:51.203
Explore your learning
insights in My Kernel.

19
00:00:51.657 --> 00:00:55.777
Turn your own lessons into quizzes,
flashcards and mind maps,

20
00:00:55.777 --> 00:00:57.087
and practise your way.

21
00:00:57.376 --> 00:01:01.026
Or even better,
open a Study Room with your friends,

22
00:01:01.026 --> 00:01:05.016
to chat, share your documents
and challenge each other,

23
00:01:05.016 --> 00:01:07.604
with Raya right there,
always ready to help.

24
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:10.972
And while you learn,
you're never on your own.

25
00:01:10.972 --> 00:01:12.552
Your school has your back.

26
00:01:12.552 --> 00:01:16.032
With Bluestift Schools, your teachers
see exactly where you're stuck,

27
00:01:16.032 --> 00:01:17.462
concept by concept.

28
00:01:17.690 --> 00:01:19.161
Never your conversations.

29
00:01:19.505 --> 00:01:22.115
They can tell Raya where
to focus and how to help,

30
00:01:22.115 --> 00:01:24.527
and ask Raya about their class in return.

31
00:01:24.913 --> 00:01:27.143
For a class, or for the whole school,

32
00:01:27.143 --> 00:01:29.914
they get a clear summary
of what's really needed.

33
00:01:29.914 --> 00:01:32.164
So they can stay close
to what matters most:

34
00:01:32.164 --> 00:01:34.576
the students who count on them every day.

35
00:01:36.150 --> 00:01:38.010
All of this runs on one layer,

36
00:01:38.010 --> 00:01:39.502
built just for it: the Kernel.

37
00:01:39.502 --> 00:01:42.802
With every attempt,
it measures what you know,

38
00:01:42.802 --> 00:01:45.432
how fast you're moving,
what really sticks,

39
00:01:45.432 --> 00:01:46.632
and your mindset.

40
00:01:47.064 --> 00:01:51.114
So when Raya guides you, it's toward
a problem the Kernel actually found.

41
00:01:51.114 --> 00:01:53.232
Not generic advice, and not a guess.

42
00:01:53.895 --> 00:01:57.535
Like a physics mistake that
really comes from a gap in maths.

43
00:01:57.535 --> 00:02:00.182
And the best part:
the Kernel grows with you.

44
00:02:00.814 --> 00:02:05.167
It assumes nothing, except that every
student matters more than any grade.

45
00:02:07.550 --> 00:02:09.630
Bluestift isn't just an AI tool,

46
00:02:09.630 --> 00:02:10.983
it's a whole ecosystem.

47
00:02:11.378 --> 00:02:13.513
And the people in it stay in control.

48
00:02:13.593 --> 00:02:17.073
You can start without an email:
a recovery key brings you back in,

49
00:02:17.073 --> 00:02:18.897
and you can replace it anytime.

50
00:02:19.116 --> 00:02:21.296
No ads, and we never sell your data.

51
00:02:21.779 --> 00:02:23.879
Analytics only runs if you say yes,

52
00:02:23.879 --> 00:02:25.997
and never for anyone under eighteen.

53
00:02:26.327 --> 00:02:29.017
Nothing a minor writes is
ever used for training,

54
00:02:29.097 --> 00:02:31.391
and adults decide with a single switch.

55
00:02:31.535 --> 00:02:34.941
Download everything,
or delete your account, whenever you want.

56
00:02:35.021 --> 00:02:37.851
And every third party we
use is listed publicly.

57
00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:42.482
So that was a quick look at Bluestift.

58
00:02:42.562 --> 00:02:43.915
Thank you for watching.

59
00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:47.100
We hope it helped you see
how it all fits together.

60
00:02:47.278 --> 00:02:50.028
To learn more, visit thebluestift.com,

61
00:02:50.028 --> 00:02:51.258
or just ask Raya.

62
00:02:51.695 --> 00:02:54.785
Now jump aboard, enjoy,
and welcome to Bluestift!

